              "type": "SEC"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "63",
          "guid": "c311efd6-cd9c-4926-a316-b04b2995e199",
          "heading": "Requirements",
          "type": "SEC",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "64",
              "guid": "bde7802f-ecb7-4b9f-993d-ba43883f5557",
              "heading": "Functional Requirements",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "65",
                  "guid": "bb8949c1-aa79-4c69-838d-b1291d68a846",
                  "heading": "G1 : Effective Tracking of FYP progress",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "66",
                      "guid": "d3a48766-526a-44c8-848e-e39f7374d8dc",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-01 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the FYP coordinator with the ability to view student progress, including milestone completion and submission status for all registered FYP students</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "67",
                      "guid": "2f00ea24-732a-4e89-b01b-0cfcd6b56077",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-02 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide supervisors with the ability to view student progress, including milestone completion and submission status of their assigned students.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with Supervisors "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "68",
                      "guid": "63df4bc9-684e-4386-92fc-90a3adc0f27d",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-03 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide students with the ability to view their own progress status.</p>",
                      "source": "Student Interview + Prototype Validation "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "69",
                      "guid": "c8ed77f5-d633-406b-8cf8-2637ceb7f475",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-04 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the supervisor with the ability to record each supervision session, including the meeting date and a summary of the discussion.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with Supervisors "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "70",
                      "guid": "0266973d-13ad-4f38-9a25-fb89292bd4d3",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-05 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide students with the ability to view their supervision meeting records and progress, including meeting date and summary of discussion</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with Supervisors "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "71",
                      "guid": "85c3a386-04dc-42b2-b3a5-1015290f9cf3",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-06 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall calculate student progress based on completed milestones and submitted deliverables.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "72",
                      "guid": "b1c39245-6ad8-4f8f-8866-be044d5b49cc",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-07 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide students with the ability to schedule a meeting with their supervisor.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with student "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "73",
                      "guid": "fe69d2c7-75c8-4740-98b4-2faed2a59813",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-08 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide a direct messaging feature to enable communication between students and supervisors.</p>",
                      "source": "Prototype validation "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "74",
                      "guid": "06a5ade9-ec88-414e-a047-a32dd26e7450",
                      "heading": "FYP-G1-09 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall allow announcements to be forwarded into the direct messaging system for targeted user communication.</p>",
                      "source": "Prototype validation "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "75",
                  "guid": "01102824-4beb-4375-bdc9-feb0e58425c8",
                  "heading": "G2 : Enable automated submission of FYP deliverables",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "76",
                      "guid": "a8277a32-f84e-40e9-ad06-c8ee7db24946",
                      "heading": "FYP-G2-01 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide students with the ability to submit FYP deliverables online.</p>",
                      "source": "FYP Guidelines (Document) "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "77",
                      "guid": "0a4ddc3e-2931-49dd-838b-3a610a325a80",
                      "heading": "FYP-G2-02 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall automatically record the submission date and time for each FYP deliverable.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "78",
                      "guid": "65ba60ec-233b-4b02-a99f-825dfafb305c",
                      "heading": "FYP-G2-03 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall update the student progress status upon submission of each FYP deliverable.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator + Prototype Validation "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "79",
                      "guid": "899a6243-25a7-47d6-875b-965ea390a9b2",
                      "heading": "FYP-G2-04 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide supervisors with the ability to view submitted FYP deliverables of their assigned students.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with Supervisors "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "80",
                      "guid": "fc91a252-85b6-4d63-90a4-486809532490",
                      "heading": "FYP-G2-05 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall notify supervisors when a student submits a FYP deliverable.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with Supervisors "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "81",
                  "guid": "7c08b6e8-1139-44fe-99a8-78e4846c3238",
                  "heading": "G3 : Manage supervisor assignment for FYP students",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "82",
                      "guid": "c9f39905-41b0-4e70-a6a2-e4155bf50754",
                      "heading": "FYP-G3-01 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the FYP coordinator with the ability to assign a supervisor to each student.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "83",
                      "guid": "5c5fa86f-4f3d-4273-9058-d1ca5562d981",
                      "heading": "FYP-G3-02 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall allow students to select their preferred supervisor.</p>",
                      "source": "FYP Guidelines (Document) + Student Interview "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "84",
                      "guid": "af65fcce-c394-482d-9d01-b1ab186f69c9",
                      "heading": "FYP-G3-03 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall enable the FYP coordinator to approve or reject students’ supervisor preferences.</p>",
                      "source": "FYP Guidelines (Document) "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "85",
                      "guid": "b4e10c78-6079-49fd-a4ac-6b38eae690b4",
                      "heading": "FYP-G3-04 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the FYP coordinator with the ability to define the maximum number of students that can be assigned to each supervisor.</p>",
                      "source": "      Faculty Workload Policy (Document) "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "86",
                      "guid": "40d57edb-2213-4798-98e7-ea90da3ee66a",
                      "heading": "FYP-G3-05 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the FYP coordinator with the ability to define the maximum number of students that can be assigned to each supervisor.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with Supervisors "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "87",
                      "guid": "7990f096-ad74-4dc2-b5eb-08e716db9ca6",
                      "heading": "FYP-G3-06 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide students with the ability to view their assigned supervisor.</p>",
                      "source": "Student Interview "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "88",
                      "guid": "36351445-1c05-4de7-a6eb-349e2cc046e4",
                      "heading": "FYP-G3-07 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall prevent assignment of students to a supervisor if the maximum supervision limit has been reached.</p>",
                      "source": "Faculty Workload Policy (Document) + Interview with Coordinator "
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "89",
                  "guid": "33318a31-5378-4c75-bfd4-00e3bd4368cc",
                  "heading": "G4 : Manage FYP Showcase",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "90",
                      "guid": "e3336a54-fcf5-4e70-b81b-01fe78a741cc",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-01 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall allow students to register for participation in the FYP showcase.</p>",
                      "source": "FYP Guidelines (Document) "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "91",
                      "guid": "c0b6f6c4-c664-4cfd-85d0-55ec79d35532",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-02 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall record the participation details of registered students.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinators ",
                      "discussion": [
                        {
                          "guid": "af1734bf-c2b7-4500-9fe6-dfd08ccb1b69",
                          "comment": "<p>Agreed !</p><p><br></p>",
                          "date": "2026-05-15T15:16:34.680Z",
                          "author": {
                            "name": "Nayli",
                            "email": "naylimohdali@gmail.com",
                            "company": "IIUM"
                          }
                        }
                      ],
                      "history": [
                        {
                          "changedBy": {
                            "company": "IIUM",
                            "email": "naylimohdali@gmail.com",
                            "name": "Nayli"
                          },
                          "changedOn": "2026-05-15T15:16:34.680Z",
                          "commentGuid": "af1734bf-c2b7-4500-9fe6-dfd08ccb1b69",
                          "updatedComment": null
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "92",
                      "guid": "e7fafeb1-d091-4577-b462-b36b6c508c0e",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-03 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the FYP coordinator with the ability to define available presentation slots, including date, time, and venue.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "93",
                      "guid": "dd7a7533-242e-4610-b9ca-3dff1e2e52df",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-04 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide students with the ability to view their assigned presentation schedule.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with students    "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "94",
                      "guid": "88a05b1c-fb98-42bf-9f2a-b21205ae2556",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-05 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the FYP coordinator with the ability to assign evaluators to presentation sessions.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "95",
                      "guid": "f4bcd99d-e224-4b9a-8382-6a3eaf5a21bc",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-06 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall allow students to select a presentation slot from the available slots.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator + Prototype Validation "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "96",
                      "guid": "c9c7e928-a662-44a9-b116-c395abcd2ac6",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-07 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall prevent students from selecting slots that are unavailable or fully booked.</p>",
                      "source": "System constraint "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "97",
                      "guid": "e5aff9cc-f1a1-4f9b-88c7-6f52eccbdaba",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-08 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall restrict slot selection to a specified booking period defined by the FYP coordinator.</p>",
                      "source": "FYP Guideline (Document) "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "98",
                      "guid": "04131e47-e396-4606-9915-38eecd7979c0",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-09 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide the FYP coordinator with the ability to create and manage announcements.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "99",
                      "guid": "1a4160c4-195f-45f0-8298-156d1a128598",
                      "heading": "FYP-G4-10 ",
                      "text": "<p>The system shall provide users with the ability to view announcements.</p>",
                      "source": "Interview with FYP Coordinator "
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "100",
              "guid": "2be25a4d-c9b0-4b15-88a9-fffa305f585d",
              "heading": "Quality Requirements",
              "type": "SEC",
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "101",
                  "guid": "873238e7-6c29-49a7-ab0a-fa3981839b51",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-01 ",
                  "text": "<p>The system shall provide role-based access control so that students are prevented from viewing or modifying other students’ grades.</p>",
                  "source": "IT Security Policy (Document) "
                },
                {
                  "id": "102",
                  "guid": "55c8d812-92d3-4918-9a6d-2399cf3114a9",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-02 ",
                  "text": "<p>The system shall ensure that the progress dashboard is responsive so that it is readable on both mobile and desktop browsers.</p>",
                  "source": "Students Interview "
                },
                {
                  "id": "103",
                  "guid": "3c588c2d-669e-4acd-854a-84d9d245f3f4",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-03 ",
                  "text": "<p>When multiple students upload deliverables simultaneously, the system shall process all files without data loss.</p>",
                  "source": "System Architect (Stakeholder) "
                },
                {
                  "id": "104",
                  "guid": "d3718e0d-853b-48f1-bfa3-2444861e2497",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-04 ",
                  "text": "<p>The system shall allow only the coordinator to modify supervisor assignments to maintain data integrity.</p>",
                  "source": "Interview with FYP coordinator "
                },
                {
                  "id": "105",
                  "guid": "063581d5-799d-49ad-b7fb-b7b3fbe87a88",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-05 ",
                  "text": "<p>The system shall generate the showcase announcement within 2 seconds of the administrator by clicking the publish button.</p>",
                  "source": "Interview with Administrator "
                },
                {
                  "id": "106",
                  "guid": "21192f33-afe8-4bcb-8b39-73e2d08706f1",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-06 ",
                  "text": "<p>The system shall be available at least 99% of the time during the final week of submission.</p>",
                  "source": "Interview with Administrator "
                },
                {
                  "id": "107",
                  "guid": "a0d2ec5b-2c9e-4c1d-84c8-3823940b92b1",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-07 ",
                  "text": "<p>The system shall provide a confirmation message after a meeting record is successfully saved.</p>",
                  "source": "Interview with Supervisor "
                },
                {
                  "id": "108",
                  "guid": "a0fc20d7-ec0a-4b7c-8062-9087922b0030",
                  "heading": "FYP-NFR-08 ",
                  "text": "<p>The system shall encrypt all uploaded project files to protect intellectual property.</p>",
                  "source": "IT Security Policy (Document) ",
                  "history": [
                    {
                      "changedBy": {
                        "company": "IIUM",
                        "email": "naylimohdali@gmail.com",
                        "name": "Nayli"
                      },
                      "changedOn": "2026-05-15T15:13:21.522Z",
                      "commentGuid": "fdd3b4f5-5efc-4b05-bdb0-38ae8b161f07",
                      "updatedComment": null
                    },
                    {
                      "changedBy": {
                        "company": "IIUM",
                        "email": "naylimohdali@gmail.com",
                        "name": "Nayli"
                      },
                      "changedOn": "2026-05-15T15:14:13.023Z",
